<title>UK: Berlin-Hannover Hypo sets 1.5 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin-Hannover Hypo sets 1.5 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Bank Gesellschaft Berlin, Commerzbank, Deutsche</p>
<p>Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Bank and Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN-HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    07.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  96.475    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    BER/HAN   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 50</p>
<p>		SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
